                  <scopecontent>
                     <p>Incipit: "I am at present at Stoke, to w<emph render="super">ch</emph> I came at half an Hour's". Sent from <geogname normal="Stoke Poges (Buckinghamshire, England, United Kingdom), inhabited place [7011896]"
